{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "3db7a3e3754cc9eeac2df77b12b60fc7ae68e2b140727db1a11122fac0ce7908", "ja": "コーディネート★パニック", "zh": "穿搭★大恐慌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "49e09803ebb7336e38dd16dac1497a1efad6cdba4fbffa47ad4e58cf8862f8f3", "ja": "美奈子が仕事で不在の中、奈緒は撮影用の衣\n装選びに。自由に選んでいいと言われて悩む\nが、プロデューサーや、見学にきていた恵美\nと歩のアドバイスを受ける事で、コーディネ\nートは完成するのだった。", "zh": "美奈子因工作不在，奈绪便去挑选拍摄用的服装。虽然被告知可以自由选择，让她很是苦恼，但在制作人以及前来参观的惠美和步的建议下，最终完成了搭配。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "620ef793fa168695865f51506c35982980da18f6681a845a3bf5b278e2273bae", "ja": "（今日は『e-m-girl』の初回撮影の衣装選び。\n美奈子が仕事で不在のため、奈緒だけなのだが……）", "zh": "（今天要挑选《e-m-girl》第一次拍摄的服装。因为美奈子有工作不在，所以只有奈绪一个人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6577f65180385df6832bae6fa717b49c4f17773bb6a74b084dc6633fdda9e09e", "ja": "……で、どうして歩と恵美がついてくるんだ？", "zh": "……话说回来，为什么步和惠美也跟过来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "a715eefe8ce3907e02e85007cbb935b1031c717feceee8b8f51a77761aa2776a", "ja": "いいじゃんいいじゃん！\nだって『e-m-girl』でしょ？　面白そうだよね！", "zh": "有什么关系嘛，有什么关系！\n因为是“e-m-girl”对吧？感觉会很有意思呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c3fa4e198946c1416605e731671637a35aec09a77ed11f618e86c54f5c88a4a9", "ja": "アタシも、ファッションの現場に興味があるし。\nジャマしないからさ、一緒に行っていい？", "zh": "我也对时尚现场很感兴趣。\n我不会添麻烦的，可以一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b3a206649a49ca45eb2cc0791a451da8c576d0ee46b18ca4fbae358aa370cb4", "ja": "私からもお願いします、{$P$}さん！\n美奈子が来られへんの、ちょっと心細かったんです！", "zh": "我也想拜托您，{$P$}先生！\n美奈子来不了，我心里有点不踏实呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "894b874eb721916643c2f6847168dd2f218659342595227fcd25661d5130d9d4", "ja": "仕方ないな……\nとはいえ仕事だから、邪魔しないようにな！", "zh": "真拿你没办法……\n不过这是工作，所以别妨碍人家哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1009_stylist", "source_sha256": "0ec646ac91ecc322569707752395c95ee114f2e4d5ae2f46469fef657c6f5ac9", "ja": "こちらに用意されているのが、各ブランドの新作に\nなります。この中から自由に選んでくださいね。", "zh": "这里准备的是各个品牌的新品。请从中自由挑选吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1010_stylist", "source_sha256": "71a36d3aa8f65b89a9d6ee2696ef5e96f51c482864eedc1669e5da9edbfadad0", "ja": "組み合わせのパターンは、いくつ考えて頂いても\n構いません。色々試してみてくださいね！", "zh": "组合方案的模式，您想考虑多少种都没关系。请尽情尝试各种方案吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "296da7903e9e12bbf0dd5e3c693ffe8b3b5809e66351856e2b858b6630ebbb67", "ja": "わかりました、ありがとうございます。\n……というわけで、奈緒。好きに選んでいいそうだ。", "zh": "明白了，谢谢你。\n……也就是说，奈绪，你可以随便选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "ef7b8875060b9d4e16603d78d02cb743191d7dc4dd0dd09bc4ff0fd8c1e3b2b1", "ja": "なんやこれ、メッチャ服と小物が並んでる……。\nん？　んー？　うーん……。", "zh": "这是什么啊，衣服和小饰品摆得满满当当的……  \n嗯？嗯——？唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6096301c63a2077619372444072da4b94a9b4af35b44c064a762aeb0515bda15", "ja": "あっ！　これって、アタシの好きなブランドじゃん！\nうわっ、次の新作かな！？　か、カッコイイ……！", "zh": "啊！这不是我喜欢的牌子嘛！\n哇，是下一季的新款吗！？好、好帅气啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "b0c29e7d7fd7adfb5d196aa9d398cea6828a572535216df70fea3dc81375ef51", "ja": "う～ん、こんなに新作の服とアクセに囲まれるとか、\nめっちゃ買い物した気分だよ！　幸せ～♪", "zh": "嗯～被这么多新款衣服和饰品包围着，感觉就像买了好多东西一样！好幸福～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8ef408bd425067c97a9bdeb14c4285f74cf3275e7ce909ce9772883208ccec46", "ja": "確かに、眺めているだけで買い物した気分になれるな。\n……奈緒？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "确实，光是看着就有种购物的感觉呢。\n……奈緒？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "227cbbfaa45a64c3e299aa60e5994879d267b2dae9bc4c3d8b1e672ebb35412d", "ja": "うがー！　わからへーんっ！！", "zh": "呜啊——！完全搞不懂啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "54812d10b70aed342b80af2c6a3f06e68ab1b2655b2bd3485a118ca1f5b1b5b8", "ja": "な、奈緒！？", "zh": "奈、奈绪！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "b681ac3f903e47172efadf133198178f65e93696efd1ff257c47e168be07acac", "ja": "コーディネートとか言われても、全然わからへんて！\nこんないっぱいあるとパニクッてまうわ～！！", "zh": "说什么穿搭，我完全搞不懂啦！\n一下子有这么多，我都要慌了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a54465462bb20c293b6802ebcf78b0781b5b0914e0edc7eab7c9ab16374265d4", "ja": "え、そう？　たとえば、このシャツとフレアパンツを\n合わせたら……ほら！　見てよ、超クール！", "zh": "诶，是吗？比如把这件衬衫和喇叭裤搭配起来……  \n看！是不是超酷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae7965abce80af0c6d30b1f2c24f99f523485b4a56d7441e970bba723024d183", "ja": "お～、いいね！　じゃあアタシは、このグレーの\nシャツワンピを羽織りにして……ね、大人っぽくない？", "zh": "哦～不错嘛！那我就把这件灰色衬衫连衣裙当作外搭……怎么样，是不是很有成熟感？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5bbf5bceb4a0b2282ab285727e57558fd2dd5145b7a9b4de240ef625111cbed2", "ja": "おおー！　やるね、恵美！", "zh": "哦——！很不错嘛，惠美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "0df0524e0067435c6bfac1bb16d8a53bf17234956939a16c280f8e774f00d08c", "ja": "めっちゃオシャレやけど……アカン……何をどう\n組み合わせたらそうなるんか、全然わからへん……。", "zh": "好时髦啊……不行……到底怎么\n搭配才能搭成那样，我完全搞不懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "43540ae01d37fd95edec3be3cc0759103f0589b9685aa8f52c8d6a9298663182", "ja": "ま、まあまあ、そう落ち込まないで……\n奈緒も、何か組み合わせてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "行了行了，别这么沮丧……\n奈绪你也试着搭配点什么看看，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "c55cfa79b885bf3c2a3ce71e4e9c2b0ca49057cbbc906aec64ceceed785449ff", "ja": "{$P$}さん、他人事やと思って\n適当言わんといてください！　……ん？　んん！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，别以为事不关己\n就随口乱说啊！……嗯？嗯嗯！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "08632f56e02b1f2aa24c29d60a79e3ca1bf76df4ee93b00f0de1751237eff26f", "ja": "お！　奈緒、なんかイイの見つけた？", "zh": "哦！奈绪，你找到什么好东西了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "be2a3c06e884e9937c4708708348cde738a816c0c00e36a8f82817cdfb9d336e", "ja": "これ！　このヒョウ柄にヒョウの顔がバーンって\nプリントされとるこれ、めっちゃカッコええやん！", "zh": "就是这个！这件豹纹上印着一张豹子脸，特别帅气不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "8fc895f46feed530ce35183327a3155d25cf80be99a058bdeb67dbd77bc94c4c", "ja": "え……。それってさー、大阪のおば……ん、ん。\nマダム要素？が強すぎるかな～って。", "zh": "诶……我就是觉得，这个是不是有点太像大阪的大……嗯、嗯。贵妇感太强了点～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "c2250f8f7ed0e08b6bd05a29791e853773b652919f9d82056a402e39090e6858", "ja": "恵美、いまおばちゃんって言いそうになったやろ！\n大阪のおばちゃん、って！", "zh": "惠美，你刚才是不是差点要说“大婶”了！  \n大阪大婶，就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "7973a5bb3642b1d97c30acdb6dc57a2ef3db2af60c8cbbcf512ca3006a6012a5", "ja": "ち、違うってば～！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "不、不是啦～！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0c7ecab48893f6dd5de1e898e1ca607c9903a63072c18a8cbf9f2fa9624c3df5", "ja": "いや、でも読モ師匠的にも、この服は難しいと思うよ。\nヒョウ柄にヒョウプリントはアタシも流石に悩むし。", "zh": "不，不过就算是读者模特师父，也觉得这套衣服很难搭哦。\n毕竟豹纹配豹子印花，连我都实在很伤脑筋啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "cb986bd88874e1050fb582ba59eca6bb96b8c24f04f3ba9d2829b5ae7fc8d93e", "ja": "うぅ……アカン、もうわからへん……。\n{$P$}さん、どうしましょう……？", "zh": "呜呜……不行了，我搞不懂了啦……\n{$P$}先生，该怎么办才好啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "06f1efe323d1a8c14e73641ce7e985848800ba36abce1cc89880412ee8c7bab9", "ja": "そうだな……自由に選ぶから、逆に難しいのかもな。\n何かテーマを決めた方が、選びやすいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊……也许正因为可以自由选择，反而更难吧。\n定个主题的话，应该会更容易选吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "9f4520d9d9976fff1c8908f66528b9f878ec0027b1c587c903ef0d3f914ba8b1", "ja": "せやな！　テーマか、テーマ……それじゃ、\n{$P$}さん、決めてください！", "zh": "是啊！主题吗，主题……那就请{$P$}先生来决定吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0a7bb446f4ce5549acde87a47f6dc9fbd0af6bf43e83880621e7a46a79de6e2a", "ja": "えっ、お、俺か？　うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "诶，要、要我来吗？嗯，让我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "820238dd9885a13458aaeb77dc5e8b9220d03cb9f4e84d0b54717cbd43421363", "ja": "やっぱりオシャレするわけだから、お出かけかな。\n『仲のいい友達と遊びに行く時に着たい服』とか？", "zh": "既然要精心打扮，那还是出门吧。\n比如“和要好的朋友出去玩时想穿的衣服”之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "1cbe264b282b9da1c93f8c3a6d65937e62ee8f9ee29c0c4256fe209535bc0d68", "ja": "友達とお出かけ……うん、それなら私もできそうです！\nさっすが{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "和朋友一起出门……嗯，那样的话我应该也能做到！\n不愧是{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "dd48e087a155437cfcdac56c79df9e2492d8cdb4342f6f190c85b78129b1308d", "ja": "恵美、歩！　今からいくつか選んでみるから、\nどんどんアドバイス頼むわ！", "zh": "惠美、步！我现在就选几套试试，\n你们尽管给我提意见啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "59fbc4d3bd8ebd9664445a0ed83ba3a96ef400974e718239acf0c2531be841c8", "ja": "（恵美と歩のアドバイスを受け、奈緒は悩みながらも、\n雑誌に載せるためのコーディネートを決めた）", "zh": "（在惠美和步的建议下，奈绪虽然苦恼了一番，还是决定好了要登上杂志的搭配。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1045_037nao", "source_sha256": "5fa0ec9f3677bdfd5706bc06bcc9866318c7856f791b1e297add954aa6a0dcfd", "ja": "アカン……悩みすぎて、もうグッタリや……\nていうか、恵美と歩はなんでそんな元気なん？", "zh": "不行了……烦恼过头，已经累瘫了……\n话说回来，惠美和步为什么还能那么有精神啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "c5061db2f42525f954008067978c598521029031f6aa8c72da0282df3b9f419d", "ja": "えっ？　だって、めちゃくちゃ楽しかったし！　\n服がいっぱいあるとさ、なんか元気になるよね♪", "zh": "诶？因为真的超级开心嘛！\n衣服一多起来，就会莫名打起精神来呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1047_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ca1c1c88d0439c7f5837c5ad6d0566a95e20fd1dcf9f2ca9245978584839487e", "ja": "そう、そうなんだよ！\n好きな服を着るとさ、パワーをもらえるんだよな～。", "zh": "对，对，就是这样！\n穿上喜欢的衣服，就能获得力量呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1048_037nao", "source_sha256": "eb98b3eadd688950c6858b9fe432a6908779c10fec9245355c0b2131121905ee", "ja": "好きな服を着ると、パワーをもらえる……。\nそれは、私にもわかるやつやんな。うん。", "zh": "穿上喜欢的衣服，就能获得力量……\n这种心情，我也很懂呢。嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1049_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d73a637999ebb7e15d14450ce81b0b84362e2d51dcad3aeb1150f2ee9501a1e8", "ja": "でもさ、今日は奈緒の服だけど、ホント楽しかったよ！\nアタシも、違うテイストに挑戦してみようかな～？", "zh": "不过啊，今天虽然穿的是奈绪的衣服，但真的特别开心！\n我也要不要挑战一下不同的风格呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1050_020meg", "source_sha256": "40931c5d30b50927f114a557a989e19fdacd0f43a72d6307ad0b0d47fe77ea70", "ja": "あ。そういえばさ、奈緒がテーマにした\n『仲のいい友達』って、誰のこと？", "zh": "啊，对了，说起来，奈绪定下的主题“关系要好的朋友”，指的是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1051_037nao", "source_sha256": "d267c9ad26356902ce080ea0975d5fdf21780e746d100b1b7ba86980365b7c88", "ja": "誰って……そんなん、決まってるやん。", "zh": "谁……那还用说，当然是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1052_020meg", "source_sha256": "65039dc8b7bf17d972690b2c9174221e93b3403fdfbc42163113d602073f29f8", "ja": "あ～、そっかそっか。ふんふん、なるほどね～。", "zh": "啊～，这样啊这样啊。嗯嗯，原来如此～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1053_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b10547c9b8fa0d6c25902fe52b1b91eab553efdb97005c3def7ac8eb3874172b", "ja": "えっ、誰？　ねえ奈緒、恵美、それって誰のこと？\nふたりとも、隠さないで教えてよ～！", "zh": "诶，谁呀？奈绪、惠美，那说的是谁啊？\n你们两个，别瞒着我，告诉我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1054_037nao", "source_sha256": "15b228eb7ac38a35e9aaf3a36cc2065274157b5d856d075bdc1ac933f5fa7152", "ja": "それは……『e-m-girl』が\n発売されてからのお楽しみやんな！", "zh": "那就等《e-m-girl》发售之后再揭晓吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "39c2d3308df078406a0ee28f028e1183a50a442e3127374fc159d586a417097f", "ja": "（慣れない事に苦戦しながらも、しっかり仕事を終えた\n奈緒の表情は、輝いている。次は美奈子の番だな！）", "zh": "（虽然在不熟悉的事情上吃了些苦头，但奈绪还是顺利完成了工作，脸上闪耀着光彩。接下来轮到美奈子了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
